{
    "title": "Homicide Squad: New York Cases",
    "description": "Do you like interesting puzzles & brainteasers or games with crime-solving?\r\n<b>Homicide Squad\u00ae</b> is a hidden object puzzle and match-3 puzzle game filled with rousing gameplay and perplexing murder mysteries!\r\n\r\n<b>The crime-solving hidden object game is calling players for duty!</b> Are you ready to solve all the puzzles and to solve all the mysterious crimes in the big city? If yes - prove your detective skills and step into a riveting world of danger, betrayal \u2026 and murder.\r\n\r\nTry this crime game with many brainteasers now and embark on a highly interactive journey. Play alongside the wisecracking Detectives Turino and Lamonte as they purge New York City of criminals and restore law and order. Just like any investigation games mean interesting gameplay where you have to feel like a detective, Homicide Squad\u00ae throws you into the thick of things with crime scene investigations. As cases stack up on your desk, you\u2019ll visit unique locations and examine troubling murder scenes.  Enjoy immersive gameplay and engaging storylines as you investigate haunting cases, interact with intriguing characters and catch twisted killers. Investigate the crime scenes and find clues. Do you have what it takes to search and find objects and solve a baffling crime? There\u2019s only one way to find out! Grab your magnifying glass and put on your detective\u2019s hat because this is one criminal thrill ride you won\u2019t want to miss!\r\n\r\nA string of horrifying homicides has been reported across the city in this gripping murder mystery game. Even the best crime investigation games are not as captivating as the stories Homicide Squad\u00ae, based on real events! To bring the perpetrators to justice and reinstate peace of mind for residents, you\u2019ll have to:\r\n\r\n<b>CHOOSE</b> your favorite gameplay mode for any scene\r\n<b>FIND CLUES</b> and hidden objects and use them or\r\n<b>MATCH GEMS</b> in a row to solve a puzzle,\r\n<b>ANALYZE</b> strange clues, and\r\n<b>SOLVE</b> mind-blowing crimes!\r\n\r\nPlus, more criminal cases, locations, characters, quests and levels are coming in regular updates that are absolutely <b>FREE</b>!\r\nIf you like free investigation games that don\u2019t need wi-fi or other internet connection, then Homicide Squad\u00ae - it's the right choice!\r\n\r\n<i>While this game is absolutely free to play, you have the ability to unlock optional bonuses via in-app purchases from within the game. You may disable in-app purchases in your device settings.</i>\r\n\r\nYou can play this game whether you\u2019re offline or online.\r\n______________________________\r\n\r\n<b>Game available in:</b> English, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese, Brazilian Portuguese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Spanish.\r\n______________________________\r\n\r\nCompatibility notes: This game performs best on high-end smartphones and tablets.\r\n______________________________\r\n\r\nG5 Games - World of Adventures\u2122!\r\nCollect them all! Search for \"g5\" in Google Play!\r\n______________________________\r\n\r\nSign up now for a weekly round-up of the best from G5 Games! <b>https://www.g5.com/e-mail</b>\r\n______________________________\r\n\r\n<b>Visit us:</b> https://www.g5.com\r\n<b>Watch us:</b> https://www.youtube.com/g5enter\r\n<b>Find us:</b> https://www.facebook.com/HomicideSquadNYC\r\n<b>Join us:</b> https://www.instagram.com/homicidesquadnyc\r\n<b>Follow us:</b> https://www.twitter.com/g5games\r\n<b>Game FAQs:</b> https://support.g5.com/hc/en-us/categories/9093103969682\r\n<b>Terms of Service:</b> https://www.g5.com/termsofservice\r\n<b>G5 End User License Supplemental Terms:</b> https://www.g5.com/G5_End_User_License_Supplemental_Terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you like interesting puzzles &amp; brainteasers or games with crime-solving?<br><b>Homicide Squad\u00ae</b> is a hidden object puzzle and match-3 puzzle game filled with rousing gameplay and perplexing murder mysteries!<br><br><b>The crime-solving hidden object game is calling players for duty!</b> Are you ready to solve all the puzzles and to solve all the mysterious crimes in the big city? If yes - prove your detective skills and step into a riveting world of danger, betrayal \u2026 and murder.<br><br>Try this crime game with many brainteasers now and embark on a highly interactive journey. Play alongside the wisecracking Detectives Turino and Lamonte as they purge New York City of criminals and restore law and order. Just like any investigation games mean interesting gameplay where you have to feel like a detective, Homicide Squad\u00ae throws you into the thick of things with crime scene investigations. As cases stack up on your desk, you\u2019ll visit unique locations and examine troubling murder scenes.  Enjoy immersive gameplay and engaging storylines as you investigate haunting cases, interact with intriguing characters and catch twisted killers. Investigate the crime scenes and find clues. Do you have what it takes to search and find objects and solve a baffling crime? There\u2019s only one way to find out! Grab your magnifying glass and put on your detective\u2019s hat because this is one criminal thrill ride you won\u2019t want to miss!<br><br>A string of horrifying homicides has been reported across the city in this gripping murder mystery game. Even the best crime investigation games are not as captivating as the stories Homicide Squad\u00ae, based on real events! To bring the perpetrators to justice and reinstate peace of mind for residents, you\u2019ll have to:<br><br><b>CHOOSE</b> your favorite gameplay mode for any scene<br><b>FIND CLUES</b> and hidden objects and use them or<br><b>MATCH GEMS</b> in a row to solve a puzzle,<br><b>ANALYZE</b> strange clues, and<br><b>SOLVE</b> mind-blowing crimes!<br><br>Plus, more criminal cases, locations, characters, quests and levels are coming in regular updates that are absolutely <b>FREE</b>!<br>If you like free investigation games that don\u2019t need wi-fi or other internet connection, then Homicide Squad\u00ae - it&#39;s the right choice!<br><br><i>While this game is absolutely free to play, you have the ability to unlock optional bonuses via in-app purchases from within the game. You may disable in-app purchases in your device settings.</i><br><br>You can play this game whether you\u2019re offline or online.<br>______________________________<br><br><b>Game available in:</b> English, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese, Brazilian Portuguese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Spanish.<br>______________________________<br><br>Compatibility notes: This game performs best on high-end smartphones and tablets.<br>______________________________<br><br>G5 Games - World of Adventures\u2122!<br>Collect them all! Search for &quot;g5&quot; in Google Play!<br>______________________________<br><br>Sign up now for a weekly round-up of the best from G5 Games! <b>https://www.g5.com/e-mail</b><br>______________________________<br><br><b>Visit us:</b> https://www.g5.com<br><b>Watch us:</b> https://www.youtube.com/g5enter<br><b>Find us:</b> https://www.facebook.com/HomicideSquadNYC<br><b>Join us:</b> https://www.instagram.com/homicidesquadnyc<br><b>Follow us:</b> https://www.twitter.com/g5games<br><b>Game FAQs:</b> https://support.g5.com/hc/en-us/categories/9093103969682<br><b>Terms of Service:</b> https://www.g5.com/termsofservice<br><b>G5 End User License Supplemental Terms:</b> https://www.g5.com/G5_End_User_License_Supplemental_Terms",
